<title>UK: SOCCER-LE TISSIER SIGNS NEW DEAL AT SOUTHAMPTON.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LE TISSIER SIGNS NEW DEAL AT SOUTHAMPTON.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHAMPTON, England 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>England midfielder Matthew Le Tissier has signed a new four-year contract with premier league Southampton.</p>
<p>The talented Le Tissier, 28, said on Thursday that he had reached a deal to stay at the club until the end of the 2000-2001 season, ending speculation about a transfer to a more glamorous English club.</p>
</text>
